# TestCase node schema
# One row per test case
id,title,pytest_path,test_type,status
# id: Unique identifier (e.g., TC-001)
# title: What contract behavior this test verifies
# pytest_path: Fully qualified path (e.g., tests/test_loader.py::TestLoader::test_load_topics)
# test_type: unit|integration|end_to_end|validation
# status: draft|implemented|passing|failing|deprecated
